{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes Remember Us</strong> \u2013 a horde-based arcade roguelike with tower-defense elements.<br>There\u2019s only one goal: <strong>Survive!</strong><br>How long can you endure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has ended. All that remains is you, the mutants \u2013 and a few lunatics who somehow found a plane and occasionally drop supplies from above. While the clock keeps ticking, every second is a fight for your life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Fire, Your Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fire is your last refuge. Lose it, and you\u2019re dead. Mutants are magically drawn to it \u2013 so defend it with everything you\u2019ve got!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Mods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881830/extras/f23338aadca6b257bb67c2ae2f9fe3e7.avif?t=1768421688\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like weapons? Perfect. Each weapon comes with unique stats and can be enhanced with modules.<br>More damage? More penetration? More range? No problem \u2013 with the right mods, no weapon ever feels the same. And don\u2019t worry: new weapon types and modules are coming soon. Promised.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traps &amp; Defense</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881830/extras/8e38504b7512873bcd19a27c6de4e9d3.avif?t=1768421688\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every good defense needs traps!<br>Specialize in building and get traps from airdrops or at the end of each round. Everything is random \u2013 because planning is boring.<br>Barbed wire, spike pits, auto-turrets, area damage \u2013 build your deadly playground. And whatever we don\u2019t have yet will come in future updates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mutants &amp; Bosses</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881830/extras/8f57690b05873ed32c5c189aea9b9ba6.poster.avif?t=1768421688\" width=300 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881830/extras/8f57690b05873ed32c5c189aea9b9ba6.webm?t=1768421688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881830/extras/9146a2dfdd89593e6b15b1e6f4318a3b.gif?t=1768421688\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881830/extras/9146a2dfdd89593e6b15b1e6f4318a3b.poster.avif?t=1768421688\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutants come in all shapes and sizes: fast, slow, ranged, heavy hitters, or hard to hit. All of them want to eat you.<br>To keep things exciting, bosses will appear regularly. Big, small, nasty \u2013 bosses everywhere. Whether they spawn at fixed intervals or randomly may change later. What\u2019s certain: they want you dead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Events &amp; Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To spice things up, random events will keep you on your toes. Strange rain? Earthquakes? Who knows what\u2019s next. One thing is certain: there will be more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes Remember Us</strong> \u2013 a roguelike where no run is the same.<br>Are you ready to defend your fire \u2013 until the bitter end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3881830?t=1768421688","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3881830?t=1